{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1093079-how-would-you-make-this-storyline-work","id":1093079,"title":"How would you make this storyline work?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-15T20:24:51-07:00","id":1093079,"title":"How would you make this storyline work?","content":"I came up with a potential Changeling story. It is basically set in a small New England town called Winterberry. You are a group of Changeling who decide to spend Halloween night inside a old cemetery telling ghost stories. But, as the midnight hour approaches, creepy stuff starts to happen. You hear faint whisphers, hear the sounds of galloping horse hoofs and other creepy shit. You realize that your stories are starting to come to life.<br /> <br /> You try to bail but you run into a even greater danger. A local street gang called The 9th Avenue Skulls have broken into the cemetery to find a hidden stash of drugs and to dispose of a body. You are now trapped in a graveyard overnight with ghosts spawned from your own imagination and a bloodthirsty Street Gang.<br /> <br /> I need advice on how to make this got on Changeling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-16T13:03:50-07:00","id":1093391,"title":"","content":"The gang is a gang of Redcaps/Unseelie/Thallian, the ghosts are nervosa or nocstina(sp) Chimera....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5533-cameraobscura83","name":"CameraObscura83","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-16T16:48:04-07:00","id":1093454,"title":"","content":"I would definitely play with themes of over coming your fears and using them to your advantage. So have the players backed into a corner an their only out is to turn the tables on the Nocnista they created an herd them in the direction of the gang members. Then get it into their heads to enchant the group of bozos an the rest of the night turns into one big chase/fight around the cemetery. You already have beautiful set pieces and a wicked setup. <br /> Just don't bring in the kung fu priest who kicks ass for the lord, that's a touch bit over doing it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1697-lostkith","name":"Lostkith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1697_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-16T20:02:12-07:00","id":1093509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lostkith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1093079-how-would-you-make-this-storyline-work?p=1093454#post1093454\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would definitely play with themes of over coming your fears and using them to your advantage. So have the players backed into a corner an their only out is to turn the tables on the Nocnista they created an herd them in the direction of the gang members. Then get it into their heads to enchant the group of bozos an the rest of the night turns into one big chase/fight around the cemetery. You already have beautiful set pieces and a wicked setup. <br /> Just don't bring in the kung fu priest who kicks ass for the lord, that's a touch bit over doing it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good idea with the theme and the Enchanting of the gangsters. Before I give them that idea however, they will have to be extremely sneaky and avoid being seen by the gangsters. Also, I might make the PCs children so the gangsters seem more like a threat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}